Add Settings -> Subscriptions, where admins keep named Claude and ChatGPT
accounts and pick the active one for each provider.

SubscriptionsPage lists each provider's accounts as a radio group (choosing
one makes it active), with edit and remove actions, and an editor dialog that
signs in through the server's helper Pod: Claude's authorize link and pasted
code, or Codex's device code. Credentials can also be imported. lib/
subscriptions.ts calls the /v1/subscriptions routes in
images/server/omnigent_subscriptions_api.py. Applies after
0016-highlighted-textarea-caret.patch.
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d).

